.TH HYPERFIDE-PLATFORM 1
.SH NAME
hyperfide-platform \- run the Hyperfide platform CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hyperfide platform
.RI [ arguments... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Executes the executable file named by HYPERFIDE_PLATFORM_BIN, then
apps/cli/bin/hyperfide-platform under the repository root, then
hyperfide-platform on PATH. Arguments, standard streams and exit status
pass through unchanged. Use hyperfide platform --help for platform commands.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
HYPERFIDE_REPO_ROOT is set to the nearest ancestor containing .git or
.codegraph, or the current directory outside a repository.
The remaining environment is inherited.
.SH EXIT STATUS
The platform CLI exit status, or 69 if the CLI cannot be found or executed.
